{{Lua|Module:Template link general}}
{{Uses TemplateStyles|Template:Mono/styles.css|Template:Nowrap/styles.css}}

This template creates example usage syntax for a template, and links the name to the template page. The name is derived from "'''T'''emplate '''l'''ist e'''x'''panded". 

Up to 7 pass parameters (numbered) for the specified template are displayed as 'placeholders', and more parameters are shown as "<code>|</code>''...''".

== Examples ==
{| class="wikitable"
! Code
! Result
! style="width:20em" | Remark
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x0}}
| {{tlx|SISTER=m:|x0}}
|
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x1|one}}
| {{tlx|x1|one}}
|
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x2|one|two}}
| {{tlx|SISTER=m:|x2|one|two}}
|
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x3|1<code>&#124;</code>2<code>&#124;</code>3}}
| {{tlx|SISTER=m:|x3|1|2|3}}
|
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x4|1<code>&#124;</code>2<code>&#124;</code>3|4}}
| {{tlx|SISTER=m:|x4|1|2|3|4}}
| up to 7 parameters, then ...
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x4|1<code>&#124;</code>2<code>&#124;</code>3&amp;#124;4}}
| {{tlx|SISTER=m:|x4|1|2|3&#124;4}}
| style="text-align: right;" | <syntaxhighlight inline lang="html">&#124;</syntaxhighlight> for more
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x1|x&#61;u}}
| {{tlx|x1|x=u}}
| '''=''' won't work
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x1|x&amp;#61;u}}
| {{tlx|x1|x&#61;u}}
| style="text-align: right;" | <syntaxhighlight inline lang="html">&#61;</syntaxhighlight> is okay
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x1|&lt;nowiki&gt;x&#61;u&lt;/nowiki&gt;}}
| {{tlx|x1|<nowiki>x=u</nowiki>}}
| style="text-align: right;" | sticky nowiki is okay
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x1|3=2=x=u}}
| {{tlx|x1|2=x=u}}
| style="text-align: right;" | numbered parameter is okay
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x1|x{{magic word|{{=}}}}u}}
| {{tlx|x1|x{{=}}u}}
| style="text-align: right;" | {{magic word|mono=1|nowrap=1|{{=}}}} is okay
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x2|&#160;|two}}
| {{tlx|SISTER=m:|x2| |two}}
| empty won't work
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x2|&amp;#32;|two}}
| {{tlx|SISTER=m:|x2|&#32;|two}}
| style="text-align: right;" | <syntaxhighlight inline lang="html">&#32;</syntaxhighlight> is okay
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x2|&amp;nbsp;|two}}
| {{tlx|SISTER=m:|x2|&nbsp;|two}}
| style="text-align: right;" | <syntaxhighlight inline lang="html">&nbsp;</syntaxhighlight> is okay
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x2| &amp;#124; two}}
| {{tlx|SISTER=m:|x2| &#124; two}}
| style="text-align: right;" | <syntaxhighlight inline lang="html">&#124;</syntaxhighlight> is okay
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x2| {{magic word|!}} two}}
| {{tlx|SISTER=m:|x2| {{!}} two}}
| style="text-align: right;" | {{magic word|!|code=1}} is dubious
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x2|<nowiki>2=</nowiki>|<nowiki>3=two</nowiki>}}
| {{tlx|SISTER=m:|x2|2=|3=two}}
| empty really doesn't work
|-
| {{tlx|tlx|x2|<nowiki>3=two</nowiki>|<nowiki>2=one</nowiki>}}
| {{tlx|SISTER=m:|x2|3=two|2=one}}
| style="text-align: right;" | right to left okay
|}

